  <!--
    Framework 0.123.0, cross-links rounds two and three (owner, 17 Nov 2026: the brakes, the cold-weather pack, dust, and the transmission
    cooler). Materials, work and skill authored on the same scale as the fittings above. Their pictures are their own since 0.191.1 (the
    owner's picks of 20 Nov 2026); the heavy-duty brakes' own since Framework 0.210.2 (paid redraw, the owner's pick of 21 Nov 2026).
